// "Double" [CR#701.10a]: one phrase, several expansions, chosen by what is
// doubled, so the declaration has no single body. Each expansion is a helper
// (`instructions/`): `doublePower`, `doubleToughness`,
// `doublePowerAndToughness` [CR#701.10b,701.10c], `doubleLifeTotal`
// [CR#701.10d] and `doubleCounters` [CR#701.10e]; doubled damage is a damage
// rule's scale [CR#701.10g]. Doubling mana [CR#701.10f] has no helper: no
// amount reads the mana a player holds.
KeywordAction(
    name: "double",
    spelling: "double",
    grammar: Verb(
        bare: "double",
        frame_set: Transitive,
    ),
)
